        {
          "description": "Student-level records from the Global Youth Tobacco Survey (GYTS) in Morocco: tobacco and e-cigarette use, exposure to second-hand smoke, media and school messages, and family background, with survey weight, stratum and primary sampling unit for design-based analysis.",
          "descriptionType": "Abstract"
        },
        {
          "description": "Origin: World Health Organization and US Centers for Disease Control and Prevention, with the Ministry of Health of Morocco, Global Youth Tobacco Survey (GYTS), Morocco. School-based survey of students aged 13 to 15. Records were taken from the BioBench R package (dataset tobaccomorocco), which took them from the biostatlab package; blank answers are coded as missing.",
